    "evidence": "Fitted to both 26 mm swingarm pivot openings in the supplied bike. Mean centers approximately Y=-61.86, Z=62.51; lateral opening faces approximately X=-64.4 and +70.3. Frame holes differ by about 1.5 mm vertically; exact alignment is not certified."
