  "placementNotes": "Order and quantity follow Motorino figure 15 and 2021 figure 17. The bearing/spacer stack uses nominal widths, spanning X=-64 to +70. Body exterior and hardware meshes are preserved. Seat depths, flange hole circles and missing sprocket/pulley mounting faces remain estimates. The body bore is illustrative and can intersect the nominal bearing envelopes; this assembly is a visual reference, not a fit-checked CAD model.",
  "explosionNotes": "Authored lateral offsets preserve coaxial bearing/spacer/seal order. The internal spacer exits to the right to reveal it. Six bolts on each end translate together along their installation axes. Distances are chosen for diagram legibility, not service travel.",
  "omitted": [
    "Motor and jackshaft pulley geometry remains omitted per the previous instruction.",
    "No output sprocket, belt, chain, pivot axle or pivot nut model was supplied in this batch."
  ],
